    "file_name": "AFP_ENG_19970415.0381.tml",
    "doc_text": "AFP_ENG_19970415.0381\n\nAACHEN, Germany, April 15 , 1997 (AFP)\n\nAachener + Muenchener reports steady annual profit\n\n\n\n\nGerman insurance company Aachener + Muenchener Versicherung (AMV) announced Tuesday that it had scored a net profit of 47.3 million marks (27.3 million dollars) last year, little changed from 47.1 million marks in 1995.\n\nA fourth of that amount (11.8 million marks) wil be used to pay dividends, the announcement said, and 18 million marks will be added to the reserves.\n\nThe company, part of Aachener + Muenchener Beteiligungs-AG, also announced a capital increase to 140.22 million marks from the current 116.85 million, put through via a transfer of 23.37 million marks from its capital reserves.",
